#Fizzleworth-rest.lic
#gets ready for resting

module FizzleworthRest

fput "store weapon"

# The new scepter (celestial silver moonstone) is too heavy for the ebon staff
# sling -- it holds ONE object up to a weight, and the runestaff lives there --
# so `store weapon` just says "Your scepter won't fit in the ebon staff sling."
# and leaves it in hand. Then `ready 2weap` pulled the runestaff into the other
# hand and Fizzleworth rested holding BOTH (10.12). Stow whatever's left in
# hand (the scepter goes to the cloak pocket, where `ready weapon` finds it
# again at prep) BEFORE readying the runestaff.
fput "stow all" if checkright || checkleft

fput "ready 2weap"

end #End of module
